.TH CTPOOL_FUTURE_CANCELLED 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
ctpool_future_cancelled \- check whether a future was cancelled
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cthreadpool.h>

bool ctpool_future_cancelled(ctpool_future *f);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns true if the task associated with this future was discarded
by ctpool_shutdown_immediate before it could execute. In that case
ctpool_future_get returns NULL and ctpool_future_done returns true.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
f   Future handle (NULL returns false)
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
true if the future was cancelled, false otherwise.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR ctpool_future_get (3),
.BR ctpool_future_done (3),
.BR ctpool_shutdown_immediate (3)
